  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are fused morphs of the Agrippan canon (Ge'ez + Old-English), never real Ethiopian/Germanic gods. Aethling seeds/shifts across all three alignments; its stance follows its CURRENT alignment (see worship_by_alignment). A literate church-and-court (the Bet-mynster) keeps the high cult; the hall and the amba-grove keep the older rites; the honored dead are kept in the church-recital and at the burial-mound.",
